{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And Nebo, and Baal-meon, renamed.</b> Nevo and Baal-meon are names of idols. The Emorites would call their cities after the name of their idol, and the sons of Reuven turned their names to other names. And this is <b>renamed</b> — Nevo and Baal-meon are turned over to another name." "<b>And Sibmah.</b> They built Sibmah, and it is Sivam mentioned above."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:35.723362907Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}